    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdoc-List Education Enrollments Waitlists-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Education Enrollment Waitlist API provides access to information regarding waitlists for various educational programs. By retrieving the details of enrollees on the waitlist, institutions can efficiently manage and prioritize incoming students. This API is particularly valuable for educational administrators and program coordinators who need to streamline their enrollment processes. Use cases include checking availability, notifying potential students, and planning capacity for upcoming terms.",
